{"unit_id": "tag:01NO:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>。\n注意，映射（map）<MATH_0003>是一个同构（isomorphism），因为<MATH_0004>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的（例如，见《概形（Schemes）》一章的引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>）。\n因此，本引理（lemma）由引理（Lemma）<REF_0002>得出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指证明中被判定为同构的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指所述映射具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "指用来推出该映射为同构的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此处为所引章节的标题。"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "用于标示引用所指向的引理。"}, {"source_term": "lemma", "target_term": "引理", "context": "指当前证明的引理。"}], "notes": []}
